# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules
#
# Trailing-slash directory canonicalisation is handled by CF Pages
# automatically — do NOT add trailing-slash-stripping rules (decision-log
# 2026-04-17). Only add semantic redirects below.
#
# Reference: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# Vanity / convention redirects --------------------------------------------
# /uses → /stack — captures the uses.tech naming convention for "what tools
# does this engineer use" pages. Many readers type /uses out of habit.
/uses          /stack/  301
/uses.tech     /stack/  301
